messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 760 and 998?', "\n\nTo find the product of **760** and **998**, we can use the distributive property to simplify the multiplication. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n760 \\times 998 &= 760 \\times (1000 - 2) \\\\\n&= 760 \\times 1000 - 760 \\times 2 \\\\\n&= 760,\\!000 - 1,\\!520 \\\\\n&= 758,\\!480\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{758,\\!480}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
