messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 828 and 612?', "\n\nTo find the product of **828** and **612**, we'll use the standard multiplication method. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}828 \\\\\n\\times\\phantom{0}612 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Step 1:** Multiply 828 by 2 (the units digit of 612).\n\n\\[\n828 \\times 2 = 1,\\!656\n\\]\n\n**Step 2:** Multiply 828 by 10 (the tens digit of 612, which is 1, but we shift one position to the left).\n\n\\[\n828 \\times 10 = 8,\\!280 \\quad (\\text{Shifted one position left})\n\\]\n\n**Step 3:** Multiply 828 by 600 (the hundreds digit of 612, which is 6, but we shift two positions to the left).\n\n\\[\n828 \\times 600 = 496,\\!800 \\quad (\\text{Shifted two positions left})\n\\]\n\n**Step 4:** Add all the results together.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}1,\\!656 \\\\\n+ \\phantom{0}8,\\!280 \\\\\n+496,\\!800 \\\\\n\\hline\n506,\\!736 \\\\\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{506,\\!736}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
