messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 611 and 117?', '\n\nTo find the product of **611** and **117**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   611 \\times 117 = 611 \\times (100 + 10 + 7)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 611 by each part separately:**\n\n   - **Multiply by 100:**\n     \\[\n     611 \\times 100 = 61,\\!100\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 10:**\n     \\[\n     611 \\times 10 = 6,\\!110\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 7:**\n     \\[\n     611 \\times 7 = 4,\\!277\n     \\]\n\n3. **Add all the results together:**\n\n   \\[\n   61,\\!100 + 6,\\!110 + 4,\\!277 = 71,\\!487\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{71,\\!487}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
