messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 614 and 332?', '\n\nTo find the product of **614** and **332**, follow these easy-to-understand steps:\n\n### Step 1: Break Down the Numbers\nUse the distributive property to simplify the multiplication:\n\\[\n614 \\times 332 = 614 \\times (300 + 30 + 2)\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply Each Part Separately\n1. **Multiply by 300:**\n\\[\n614 \\times 300 = 184,\\!200\n\\]\n2. **Multiply by 30:**\n\\[\n614 \\times 30 = 18,\\!420\n\\]\n3. **Multiply by 2:**\n\\[\n614 \\times 2 = 1,\\!228\n\\]\n\n### Step 3: Add All the Results Together\n\\[\n184,\\!200 + 18,\\!420 + 1,\\!228 = 203,\\!848\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\\[\n\\boxed{203,\\!848}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
