messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 463 and 693?', "\n\nTo find the product of **463** and **693**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n463 \\times 693 &= 463 \\times (600 + 90 + 3) \\\\\n&= 463 \\times 600 + 463 \\times 90 + 463 \\times 3 \\\\\n&= 277,\\!800 + 41,\\!670 + 1,\\!389 \\\\\n&= 277,\\!800 + 41,\\!670 \\\\\n&= 319,\\!470 \\\\\n&= 319,\\!470 + 1,\\!389 \\\\\n&= 320,\\!859 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{320,\\!859}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
