messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 526 and 957?', "\n\nTo find the product of **526** and **957**, we'll use the **standard multiplication algorithm**. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n### Step 1: Multiply 526 by 7 (the units digit of 957)\n\\[\n526 \\times 7 = 3,\\!682\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply 526 by 50 (the tens digit of 957, shifted one position to the left)\n\\[\n526 \\times 50 = 26,\\!300\n\\]\n\n### Step 3: Multiply 526 by 900 (the hundreds digit of 957, shifted two positions to the left)\n\\[\n526 \\times 900 = 473,\\!400\n\\]\n\n### Step 4: Add all the partial products together\n\\[\n3,\\!682 + 26,\\!300 + 473,\\!400 = 503,\\!382\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\\[\n\\boxed{503,\\!382}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
