messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 332 and 499?', "\n\nTo find the product of **332** and **499**, we can use the distributive property to simplify the multiplication. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n332 \\times 499 &= 332 \\times (500 - 1) \\\\\n&= 332 \\times 500 - 332 \\times 1 \\\\\n&= 166,\\!000 - 332 \\\\\n&= 165,\\!668\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{165,\\!668}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
