messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 310 and 687?', '\n\nTo find the product of **310** and **687**, follow these easy-to-understand steps:\n\n### Step 1: Break Down the Numbers\nFirst, express each number in expanded form to make multiplication simpler.\n\n\\[\n310 = 300 + 10\n\\]\n\\[\n687 = 600 + 80 + 7\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply Each Part\nMultiply each part of **310** by each part of **687**.\n\n1. **Multiply 300 by each part of 687:**\n   \\[\n   300 \\times 600 = 180,\\!000\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   300 \\times 80 = 24,\\!000\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   300 \\times 7 = 2,\\!100\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 10 by each part of 687:**\n   \\[\n   10 \\times 600 = 6,\\!000\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   10 \\times 80 = 800\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   10 \\times 7 = 70\n   \\]\n\n### Step 3: Add All the Products Together\nNow, sum all the results from the previous step:\n\n\\[\n180,\\!000 + 24,\\!000 + 2,\\!100 + 6,\\!000 + 800 + 70 = 212,\\!970\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\\[\n\\boxed{212,\\!970}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
