messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 257 and 203?', '\n\nTo find the product of **257** and **203**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   257 \\times 203 = 257 \\times (200 + 3)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 257 by each part separately:**\n\n   - **Multiply by 200:**\n     \n     \\[\n     257 \\times 200 = 51,\\!400\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 3:**\n     \n     \\[\n     257 \\times 3 = 771\n     \\]\n\n3. **Add the two results together:**\n\n   \\[\n   51,\\!400 + 771 = 52,\\!171\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{52,\\!171}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
