messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 292 and 345?', "\n\nTo find the product of **292** and **345**, we'll use the standard multiplication method. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n292 \\times 345 &= 292 \\times (300 + 40 + 5) \\\\\n&= 292 \\times 300 + 292 \\times 40 + 292 \\times 5 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!600 + 11,\\!680 + 1,\\!460 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!600 + 11,\\!680 \\\\\n&= 99,\\!280 \\\\\n&= 99,\\!280 + 1,\\!460 \\\\\n&= 100,\\!740 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{100,\\!740}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
