      "text": "189,333.\n\\end{align*}.\n\\]\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Break Down the Multiplication:**\n   - Recognize that multiplying by **193** can be simplified by breaking it down into **200 - 7**.\n   - This makes the calculation easier by using the distributive property.\n\n2. **Multiply 981 by 200:**\n   - \\( 981 \\times 200 = 196,200 \\).\n   - This is straightforward since multiplying by **100** shifts the number two places to the left, and multiplying by **2** doubles it.\n\n3. **Multiply 981 by 7:**\n   - \\( 981 \\times 7 = 6,867 \\).\n   - Perform the multiplication step by step:\n     - \\( 1 \\times 7 = 7 \\).\n     - \\( 80 \\times 7 = 560 \\).\n     - \\( 900 \\times 7 = 6,300 \\).\n     - Adding these together: \\( 6,300 + 560 + 7 = 6,867 \\).\n\n4. **Subtract the Two Results:**\n   - Subtract \\( 6,867 \\) from \\( 196,200 \\):\n     - \\( 196,200 - 6,867 = 189,333 \\).\n\n5. **Final Answer:**\n   - The product of **981** and **193** is **189,333**.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **981** and **193**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n981 \\times 193 &= 981 \\times (200 - 7) \\\\\n&= 981 \\times 200 - 981 \\times 7 \\\\\n&= 196,\\!200 - 6,\\!867 \\\\\n&= 189,\\!333\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Break Down the Multiplication:**\n   - Recognize that multiplying by **193** can be simplified by breaking it down into **200 - 7**.\n   - This makes the calculation easier by using the distributive property.\n\n2. **Multiply 981 by 200:**\n   \\[\n   981 \\times 200 = 196,\\!200\n   \\]\n   - Multiply 981 by 2 to get 1,\\!962, then add two zeros to get 196,\\!200.\n\n3. **Multiply 981 by 7:**\n   \\[\n   981 \\times 7 = 6,\\!867\n   \\]\n   - Calculate each digit:\n     - \\(1 \\times 7 = 7\\)\n     - \\(80 \\times 7 = 560\\)\n     - \\(900 \\times 7 = 6,\\!300\\)\n   - Add them together: \\(6,\\!300 + 560 + 7 = 6,\\!867\\)\n\n4. **Subtract the Two Results:**\n   \\[\n   196,\\!200 - 6,\\!867 = 189,\\!333\n   \\]\n\n5. **Final Answer:**\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{189,\\!333}\n   \\]",
