messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 129 and 640?', '\n\nTo find the product of **129** and **640**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   129 \\times 640 = 129 \\times (600 + 40)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 129 by each part separately:**\n\n   - **Multiply by 600:**\n     \\[\n     129 \\times 600 = 129 \\times 6 \\times 100 = 774 \\times 100 = 77,\\!400\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 40:**\n     \\[\n     129 \\times 40 = 129 \\times 4 \\times 10 = 516 \\times 10 = 5,\\!160\n     \\]\n\n3. **Add the two results together:**\n\n   \\[\n   77,\\!400 + 5,\\!160 = 82,\\!560\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{82,\\!560}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
