messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 325 and 745?', "\n\nTo find the product of **325** and **745**, we'll use the standard multiplication method. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}325 \\\\\n\\times\\phantom{0}745 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Step 1: Multiply 325 by 5 (units place of 745)**\n\n\\[\n325 \\times 5 = 1,\\!625\n\\]\n\n**Step 2: Multiply 325 by 40 (tens place of 745)**\n\n\\[\n325 \\times 40 = 13,\\!000\n\\]\n\n**Step 3: Multiply 325 by 700 (hundreds place of 745)**\n\n\\[\n325 \\times 700 = 227,\\!500\n\\]\n\n**Step 4: Add all the results together**\n\n\\[\n1,\\!625 + 13,\\!000 + 227,\\!500 = 242,\\!125\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{242,\\!125}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
