messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 604 and 206?', '\n\nTo find the product of **604** and **206**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   604 \\times 206 = 604 \\times (200 + 6)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 604 by each part separately:**\n\n   - **Multiply by 200:**\n     \n     \\[\n     604 \\times 200 = 120,\\!800\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 6:**\n     \n     \\[\n     604 \\times 6 = 3,\\!624\n     \\]\n\n3. **Add the two results together:**\n\n   \\[\n   120,\\!800 + 3,\\!624 = 124,\\!424\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{124,\\!424}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
