messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 109 and 490?', '\n\nTo find the product of **109** and **490**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   109 \\times 490 = 109 \\times (400 + 90)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 109 by each part separately:**\n\n   - **Multiply by 400:**\n     \n     \\[\n     109 \\times 400 = 109 \\times 4 \\times 100 = 436 \\times 100 = 43,\\!600\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 90:**\n     \n     \\[\n     109 \\times 90 = 109 \\times 9 \\times 10 = 981 \\times 10 = 9,\\!810\n     \\]\n\n3. **Add the two results together:**\n\n   \\[\n   43,\\!600 + 9,\\!810 = 53,\\!410\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{53,\\!410}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
