messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 463 and 168?', "\n\nTo find the product of **463** and **168**, we'll use the **standard multiplication algorithm**. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n### Step 1: Multiply 463 by 8 (the units digit of 168)\n\\[\n463 \\times 8 = 3,\\!704\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply 463 by 60 (the tens digit of 168, shifted one position to the left)\n\\[\n463 \\times 60 = 27,\\!780\n\\]\n\n### Step 3: Multiply 463 by 100 (the hundreds digit of 168, shifted two positions to the left)\n\\[\n463 \\times 100 = 46,\\!300\n\\]\n\n### Step 4: Add all the partial products together\n\\[\n3,\\!704 + 27,\\!780 + 46,\\!300 = 77,\\!784\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\\[\n\\boxed{77,\\!784}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
