messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 736 and 698?', "\n\nTo find the product of **736** and **698**, we can use the **difference of squares** method for easier calculation. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n736 \\times 698 &= (700 + 36) \\times (700 - 2) \\\\\n&= 700^2 - 2^2 \\quad \\text{(Using the difference of squares formula: } (a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2) \\\\\n&= 490,\\!000 - 4 \\\\\n&= 489,\\!996\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{489,\\!996}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
