messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 737 and 599?', "\n\nTo find the product of **737** and **599**, we can use the distributive property to simplify the multiplication. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n737 \\times 599 &= 737 \\times (600 - 1) \\\\\n&= 737 \\times 600 - 737 \\times 1 \\\\\n&= 442,\\!200 - 737 \\\\\n&= 441,\\!463\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{441,\\!463}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
