messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 720 and 348?', '\n\nTo find the product of **720** and **348**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   720 \\times 348 = 720 \\times (300 + 40 + 8)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 720 by each part separately:**\n\n   - **Multiply by 300:**\n     \\[\n     720 \\times 300 = 720 \\times 3 \\times 100 = 2160 \\times 100 = 216,\\!000\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 40:**\n     \\[\n     720 \\times 40 = 720 \\times 4 \\times 10 = 2880 \\times 10 = 28,\\!800\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 8:**\n     \\[\n     720 \\times 8 = 5,\\!760\n     \\]\n\n3. **Add all the results together:**\n\n   \\[\n   216,\\!000 + 28,\\!800 + 5,\\!760 = 250,\\!560\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{250,\\!560}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
