messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 628 and 561?', "\n\nTo find the product of **628** and **561**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n628 \\times 561 &= 628 \\times (500 + 60 + 1) \\\\\n&= 628 \\times 500 + 628 \\times 60 + 628 \\times 1 \\\\\n&= 314,\\!000 + 37,\\!680 + 628 \\\\\n&= 314,\\!000 + 37,\\!680 \\\\\n&= 351,\\!680 \\\\\n&= 351,\\!680 + 628 \\\\\n&= 352,\\!308\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{352,\\!308}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
