messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 140 and 127?', '\n\nTo find the product of **140** and **127**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   140 \\times 127 = 140 \\times (100 + 20 + 7)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 140 by each part separately:**\n\n   \\[\n   140 \\times 100 = 14,\\!000\n   \\]\n   \n   \\[\n   140 \\times 20 = 2,\\!800\n   \\]\n   \n   \\[\n   140 \\times 7 = 980\n   \\]\n\n3. **Add the results together:**\n\n   \\[\n   14,\\!000 + 2,\\!800 + 980 = 17,\\!780\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{17,\\!780}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
