messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 894 and 719?', "\n\nTo find the product of **894** and **719**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n894 \\times 719 &= 894 \\times (700 + 19) \\\\\n&= 894 \\times 700 + 894 \\times 19 \\\\\n&= 625,\\!800 + (894 \\times 10 + 894 \\times 9) \\\\\n&= 625,\\!800 + (8,\\!940 + 8,\\!046) \\\\\n&= 625,\\!800 + 16,\\!986 \\\\\n&= 642,\\!786\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{642,\\!786}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
