messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 309 and 390?', '\n\nTo find the product of **309** and **390**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break Down the Multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   309 \\times 390 = 309 \\times (300 + 90)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 309 by 300:**\n\n   \\[\n   309 \\times 300 = 92,\\!700\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 309 by 90:**\n\n   \\[\n   309 \\times 90 = 27,\\!810\n   \\]\n\n4. **Add the Two Results Together:**\n\n   \\[\n   92,\\!700 + 27,\\!810 = 120,\\!510\n   \\]\n\n5. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{120,\\!510}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
