messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 750 and 110?', '\n\nTo find the product of **750** and **110**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break Down the Multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   750 \\times 110 = 750 \\times (100 + 10)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 750 by Each Part Separately:**\n\n   - **Multiply by 100:**\n     \n     \\[\n     750 \\times 100 = 75,\\!000\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 10:**\n     \n     \\[\n     750 \\times 10 = 7,\\!500\n     \\]\n\n3. **Add the Results Together:**\n\n   \\[\n   75,\\!000 + 7,\\!500 = 82,\\!500\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{82,\\!500}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
