messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 220 and 776?', "\n\nTo find the product of **220** and **776**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n### Step 1: Break Down the Numbers\nWe can break down the multiplication into more manageable parts using the distributive property.\n\n\\[\n220 \\times 776 = (200 + 20) \\times (700 + 70 + 6)\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply Each Part\nNow, multiply each part of the first number by each part of the second number.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n200 \\times 700 &= 140,\\!000 \\\\\n200 \\times 70 &= 14,\\!000 \\\\\n200 \\times 6 &= 1,\\!200 \\\\\n20 \\times 700 &= 14,\\!000 \\\\\n20 \\times 70 &= 1,\\!400 \\\\\n20 \\times 6 &= 120 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n### Step 3: Add All the Products Together\nSum all the results from the previous step.\n\n\\[\n140,\\!000 + 14,\\!000 + 1,\\!200 + 14,\\!000 + 1,\\!400 + 120 = 170,\\!720\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\\[\n\\boxed{170,\\!720}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
