messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 905 and 146?', '\n\nTo find the product of **905** and **146**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   905 \\times 146 = 905 \\times (100 + 40 + 6)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 905 by each part separately:**\n\n   - **Multiply by 100:**\n     \\[\n     905 \\times 100 = 90,\\!500\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 40:**\n     \\[\n     905 \\times 40 = 36,\\!200\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 6:**\n     \\[\n     905 \\times 6 = 5,\\!430\n     \\]\n\n3. **Add all the results together:**\n\n   \\[\n   90,\\!500 + 36,\\!200 + 5,\\!430 = 132,\\!130\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{132,\\!130}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
