messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 183 and 373?', "\n\nTo find the product of **183** and **373**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n183 \\times 373 &= 183 \\times (300 + 70 + 3) \\\\\n&= (183 \\times 300) + (183 \\times 70) + (183 \\times 3) \\\\\n&= 54,\\!900 + 12,\\!810 + 549 \\\\\n&= 54,\\!900 + 12,\\!810 \\\\\n&= 67,\\!710 \\\\\n&\\quad + \\quad 549 \\\\\n&= 68,\\!259\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{68,\\!259}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
