messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 171 and 271?', '\n\nTo find the product of **171** and **271**, follow these easy-to-understand steps:\n\n### Step 1: Break Down the Numbers\nSplit **271** into **200**, **70**, and **1** to simplify the multiplication.\n\n\\[\n171 \\times 271 = 171 \\times (200 + 70 + 1)\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply Each Part\nMultiply **171** by each of the split parts.\n\n1. **Multiply by 200:**\n   \\[\n   171 \\times 200 = 34,\\!200\n   \\]\n   \n2. **Multiply by 70:**\n   \\[\n   171 \\times 70 = 11,\\!970\n   \\]\n   \n3. **Multiply by 1:**\n   \\[\n   171 \\times 1 = 171\n   \\]\n\n### Step 3: Add the Results Together\nSum up all the products from the previous step.\n\n\\[\n34,\\!200 + 11,\\!970 + 171 = 46,\\!341\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\\[\n\\boxed{46,\\!341}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
