messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 191 and 871?', '\n\nTo find the product of **191** and **871**, follow these easy-to-understand steps:\n\n### Step 1: Break Down the Numbers\nUse the distributive property to simplify the multiplication:\n\n\\[\n191 \\times 871 = 191 \\times (800 + 70 + 1)\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply Each Part Separately\n\n1. **Multiply by 800:**\n   \\[\n   191 \\times 800 = 152,\\!800\n   \\]\n   \n2. **Multiply by 70:**\n   \\[\n   191 \\times 70 = 13,\\!370\n   \\]\n   \n3. **Multiply by 1:**\n   \\[\n   191 \\times 1 = 191\n   \\]\n\n### Step 3: Add All the Results Together\n\n\\[\n152,\\!800 + 13,\\!370 + 191 = 166,\\!361\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{166,\\!361}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
