messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 916 and 811?', "\n\nTo find the product of **916** and **811**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n916 \\times 811 &= 916 \\times (800 + 10 + 1) \\\\\n&= 916 \\times 800 + 916 \\times 10 + 916 \\times 1 \\\\\n&= 732,\\!800 + 9,\\!160 + 916 \\\\\n&= 732,\\!800 + 9,\\!160 \\\\\n&= 741,\\!960 \\\\\n&= 741,\\!960 + 916 \\\\\n&= 742,\\!876\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{742,\\!876}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
