messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 531 and 265?', "\n\nTo find the product of **531** and **265**, we'll use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n### Step 1: Multiply 531 by 5 (the units digit of 265)\n\\[\n531 \\times 5 = 2,\\!655\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply 531 by 60 (the tens digit of 265, shifted one position to the left)\n\\[\n531 \\times 60 = 31,\\!860\n\\]\n\n### Step 3: Multiply 531 by 200 (the hundreds digit of 265, shifted two positions to the left)\n\\[\n531 \\times 200 = 106,\\!200\n\\]\n\n### Step 4: Add all the partial products together\n\\[\n2,\\!655 + 31,\\!860 + 106,\\!200 = 140,\\!715\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\\[\n\\boxed{140,\\!715}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
