messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 651 and 653?', "\n\nTo find the product of **651** and **653**, we can use the **difference of squares** formula, which simplifies the multiplication process. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n651 \\times 653 &= (652 - 1) \\times (652 + 1) \\\\\n&= 652^2 - 1^2 \\quad \\text{(Using the difference of squares formula)} \\\\\n&= 652^2 - 1 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\nNow, calculate \\(652^2\\):\n\n\\[\n652^2 = 652 \\times 652 = 425,\\!104\n\\]\n\nSubtract 1 from this result:\n\n\\[\n425,\\!104 - 1 = 425,\\!103\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the product of **651** and **653** is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{425,\\!103}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
