messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 447 and 539?', "\n\nTo find the product of **447** and **539**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n447 \\times 539 &= 447 \\times (500 + 30 + 9) \\\\\n&= 447 \\times 500 + 447 \\times 30 + 447 \\times 9 \\\\\n&= 223,\\!500 + 13,\\!410 + 4,\\!023 \\\\\n&= 223,\\!500 + 13,\\!410 \\\\\n&= 236,\\!910 \\\\\n&= 236,\\!910 + 4,\\!023 \\\\\n&= 240,\\!933 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{240,\\!933}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
