messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 379 and 418?', ".\n\nTo find the product of **379** and **418**, we'll use the standard multiplication method. Here's a step-by-step solution:.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n\\phantom{0}379 \\\\.\n\\times\\phantom{0}418 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n**Step 1:** Multiply 379 by 8 (the units digit of 418).\n\n\\[.\n379 \\times 8 = 3032.\n\\].\n\n**Step 2:** Multiply 379 by 10 (the tens digit of 418, shifted one position to the left).\n\n\\[.\n379 \\times 10 = 3790 \\quad (\\text{Shifted one position left}).\n\\].\n\n**Step 3:** Multiply 379 by 400 (the hundreds digit of 418, shifted two positions to the left).\n\n\\[.\n379 \\times 400 = 151600 \\quad (\\text{Shifted two positions left}).\n\\].\n\n**Step 4:** Add all the partial products together.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n\\phantom{0}3032 \\\\.\n+ \\phantom{0}3790 \\\\.\n+151600 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n158422 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, the answer is "]]
