messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 558 and 192?', "\n\nTo find the product of **558** and **192**, we'll use the **distributive property** to simplify the multiplication.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n558 \\times 192 &= 558 \\times (200 - 8) \\\\\n&= 558 \\times 200 - 558 \\times 8 \\\\\n&= 111,\\!600 - 4,\\!464 \\\\\n&= 106,\\!176\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{106,\\!176}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
