messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 640 and 272?', '\n\nTo find the product of **640** and **272**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   640 \\times 272 = 640 \\times (200 + 70 + 2)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 640 by each part separately:**\n\n   - **Multiply by 200:**\n     \\[\n     640 \\times 200 = 128,\\!000\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 70:**\n     \\[\n     640 \\times 70 = 44,\\!800\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Multiply by 2:**\n     \\[\n     640 \\times 2 = 1,\\!280\n     \\]\n\n3. **Add all the results together:**\n\n   \\[\n   128,\\!000 + 44,\\!800 + 1,\\!280 = 174,\\!080\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{174,\\!080}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
