messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 206 and 428?', "\n\nTo find the product of **206** and **428**, we'll use the standard multiplication method. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}206 \\\\\n\\times 428 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Step 1:** Multiply 206 by 8 (the units digit of 428):\n\n\\[\n206 \\times 8 = 1,\\!648\n\\]\n\n**Step 2:** Multiply 206 by 20 (the tens digit of 428, which is 2 multiplied by 10):\n\n\\[\n206 \\times 20 = 4,\\!120\n\\]\n\n**Step 3:** Multiply 206 by 400 (the hundreds digit of 428, which is 4 multiplied by 100):\n\n\\[\n206 \\times 400 = 82,\\!400\n\\]\n\n**Step 4:** Add all the partial products together:\n\n\\[\n1,\\!648 + 4,\\!120 + 82,\\!400 = 88,\\!168\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{88,\\!168}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
