messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 340 and 988?', '\n\nTo find the product of **340** and **988**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   340 \\times 988 = 340 \\times (1000 - 12)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 340 by each part separately:**\n\n   \\[\n   340 \\times 1000 = 340,\\!000\n   \\]\n   \n   \\[\n   340 \\times 12 = 4,\\!080\n   \\]\n\n3. **Subtract the second product from the first:**\n\n   \\[\n   340,\\!000 - 4,\\!080 = 335,\\!920\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{335,\\!920}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
