messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 848 and 331?', "\n\nTo find the product of **848** and **331**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n848 \\times 331 &= 848 \\times (300 + 30 + 1) \\\\\n&= 848 \\times 300 + 848 \\times 30 + 848 \\times 1 \\\\\n&= 254,\\!400 + 25,\\!440 + 848 \\\\\n&= 254,\\!400 + 25,\\!440 \\\\\n&= 279,\\!840 \\\\\n&= 279,\\!840 + 848 \\\\\n&= 280,\\!688\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{280,\\!688}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
