messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 176 and 122?', '\n\nTo find the product of **176** and **122**, follow these easy steps:\n\n### Step 1: Break Down the Multiplication\nUse the distributive property to simplify the multiplication:\n\n\\[\n176 \\times 122 = 176 \\times (100 + 20 + 2)\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply Each Part Separately\nCalculate each part of the multiplication:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n176 \\times 100 &= 17,\\!600 \\\\\n176 \\times 20 &= 3,\\!520 \\\\\n176 \\times 2 &= 352 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n### Step 3: Add the Results Together\nSum all the partial products:\n\n\\[\n17,\\!600 + 3,\\!520 + 352 = 21,\\!472\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\\[\n\\boxed{21,\\!472}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
