messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 146 and 377?', '\n\nTo find the product of **146** and **377**, follow these easy-to-understand steps:\n\n### Step 1: Break Down the Numbers\nUse the distributive property to simplify the multiplication:\n\\[\n146 \\times 377 = 146 \\times (300 + 70 + 7)\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply Each Part\n1. **Multiply by 300:**\n\\[\n146 \\times 300 = 43,\\!800\n\\]\n2. **Multiply by 70:**\n\\[\n146 \\times 70 = 10,\\!220\n\\]\n3. **Multiply by 7:**\n\\[\n146 \\times 7 = 1,\\!022\n\\]\n\n### Step 3: Add All the Products Together\n\\[\n43,\\!800 + 10,\\!220 + 1,\\!022 = 55,\\!042\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\\[\n\\boxed{55,\\!042}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
