messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 110 and 457?', '\n\nTo find the product of **110** and **457**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   110 \\times 457 = (100 + 10) \\times 457\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply each part separately:**\n\n   \\[\n   100 \\times 457 = 45,\\!700\n   \\]\n   \n   \\[\n   10 \\times 457 = 4,\\!570\n   \\]\n\n3. **Add the results together:**\n\n   \\[\n   45,\\!700 + 4,\\!570 = 50,\\!270\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{50,\\!270}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
