messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 812 and 556?', "\n\nTo find the product of **812** and **556**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n812 \\times 556 &= 812 \\times (500 + 50 + 6) \\\\\n&= 812 \\times 500 + 812 \\times 50 + 812 \\times 6 \\\\\n&= 406,\\!000 + 40,\\!600 + 4,\\!872 \\\\\n&= 406,\\!000 + 40,\\!600 \\\\\n&= 446,\\!600 \\\\\n&= 446,\\!600 + 4,\\!872 \\\\\n&= 451,\\!472\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{451,\\!472}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
