messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 229 and 311?', "\n\nTo find the product of **229** and **311**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n229 \\times 311 &= 229 \\times (300 + 10 + 1) \\\\\n&= (229 \\times 300) + (229 \\times 10) + (229 \\times 1) \\\\\n&= 68,\\!700 + 2,\\!290 + 229 \\\\\n&= 68,\\!700 + 2,\\!290 \\\\\n&= 70,\\!990 \\\\\n&= 70,\\!990 + 229 \\\\\n&= 71,\\!219\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{71,\\!219}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
