messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 120 and 268?', '\n\n**Solution:**\n\nTo find the product of **120** and **268**, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Multiply 120 by 200:**\n   \n   \\[\n   120 \\times 200 = 24,\\!000\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 120 by 60:**\n   \n   \\[\n   120 \\times 60 = 7,\\!200\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 120 by 8:**\n   \n   \\[\n   120 \\times 8 = 960\n   \\]\n\n4. **Add all the results together:**\n   \n   \\[\n   24,\\!000 + 7,\\!200 + 960 = 32,\\!160\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{32,\\!160}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
