messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 794 and 536?', "\n\nTo find the product of **794** and **536**, we'll use the standard multiplication method. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}794 \\\\\n\\times\\phantom{0}536 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Step 1: Multiply 794 by 6 (units place of 536)**\n\n\\[\n794 \\times 6 = 4,\\!764\n\\]\n\n**Step 2: Multiply 794 by 30 (tens place of 536)**\n\n\\[\n794 \\times 30 = 23,\\!820\n\\]\n\n**Step 3: Multiply 794 by 500 (hundreds place of 536)**\n\n\\[\n794 \\times 500 = 397,\\!000\n\\]\n\n**Step 4: Add all the results together**\n\n\\[\n4,\\!764 + 23,\\!820 + 397,\\!000 = 425,\\!584\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{425,\\!584}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
