messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 623 and 884?', "\n\nTo find the product of **623** and **884**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n623 \\times 884 &= 623 \\times (800 + 80 + 4) \\\\\n&= 623 \\times 800 + 623 \\times 80 + 623 \\times 4 \\\\\n&= 498,\\!400 + 49,\\!840 + 2,\\!492 \\\\\n&= 550,\\!732\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{550,\\!732}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
