messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 406 and 543?', '\n\nTo find the product of **406** and **543**, follow these easy-to-understand steps:\n\n### Step 1: Break Down the Numbers\nUse the distributive property to simplify the multiplication:\n\n\\[\n406 \\times 543 = 406 \\times (500 + 40 + 3)\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply Each Part Separately\n\n1. **Multiply by 500:**\n   \\[\n   406 \\times 500 = 203,\\!000\n   \\]\n   \n2. **Multiply by 40:**\n   \\[\n   406 \\times 40 = 16,\\!240\n   \\]\n   \n3. **Multiply by 3:**\n   \\[\n   406 \\times 3 = 1,\\!218\n   \\]\n\n### Step 3: Add All the Results Together\n\n\\[\n203,\\!000 + 16,\\!240 + 1,\\!218 = 220,\\!458\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{220,\\!458}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
