messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 383 and 210?', '\n\nTo find the product of **383** and **210**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n\n   \\[\n   383 \\times 210 = 383 \\times (200 + 10)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 383 by each part separately:**\n\n   - **Multiply by 200:**\n     \n     \\[\n     383 \\times 200 = 76,\\!600\n     \\]\n     \n   - **Multiply by 10:**\n     \n     \\[\n     383 \\times 10 = 3,\\!830\n     \\]\n\n3. **Add the two results together:**\n\n   \\[\n   76,\\!600 + 3,\\!830 = 80,\\!430\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{80,\\!430}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
