messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 446 and 448?', "\n\nTo find the product of **446** and **448**, we can use the **difference of squares** formula for a more straightforward calculation. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n446 \\times 448 = (447 - 1) \\times (447 + 1)\n\\]\n\nUsing the difference of squares formula:\n\n\\[\n(a - b)(a + b) = a^2 - b^2\n\\]\n\nWhere:\n- \\( a = 447 \\)\n- \\( b = 1 \\)\n\n\\[\n446 \\times 448 = 447^2 - 1^2\n\\]\n\nCalculate \\( 447^2 \\):\n\n\\[\n447^2 = 447 \\times 447 = 199,\\!809\n\\]\n\nNow, subtract \\( 1^2 \\):\n\n\\[\n199,\\!809 - 1 = 199,\\!808\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the product of **446** and **448** is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{199,\\!808}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
