messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 372 and 838?', "\n\nTo find the product of **372** and **838**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n372 \\times 838 &= 372 \\times (800 + 38) \\\\\n&= 372 \\times 800 + 372 \\times 38 \\\\\n&= 297,\\!600 + (372 \\times 30 + 372 \\times 8) \\\\\n&= 297,\\!600 + (11,\\!160 + 2,\\!976) \\\\\n&= 297,\\!600 + 14,\\!136 \\\\\n&= 311,\\!736\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{311,\\!736}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
